toastsaver (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * New screensavers: RAINBOW (the Waffle Cat flies on a rainbow),
    BOOKS (books fly off a cozy shelf and open to little moving
    pictures) and BIRDS (songbirds over summer hills).
  * LAVA rewritten: wax that warms, rises, cools and sinks inside a
    glowing glass lamp.
  * The picker grows to four columns to fit eleven savers.

